# Checkpoints are large binary artifacts (~5 MB of pickled hippocampus).
# They stay on disk for local resume testing but are regenerated, not tracked:
#   python src/nowa_sandbox/run_sandbox.py --checkpoint results/<name>.ckpt
*.ckpt
*.ckpt.agent.nowa
*.pkl

# Per-run JSON summaries are small and readable, so they are kept.
!*.json
